Third-party data and libraries retain their own licenses (see README.md,
"数据来源与许可证"). In particular:

- Tycho-2 catalogue: ESA Hipparcos/Tycho mission data prepared by Hog et al.
  (2000), distributed via CDS VizieR I/259. Scientific/educational use with
  citation of Hog E., Fabricius C., Makarov V.V., et al. 2000, A&A 355, L27.
- HYG database v41: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://github.com/astronexus/HYG-Database).
- IAU Catalog of Star Names: IAU Working Group on Star Names; free use with
  credit.
- Constellation lines and Chinese star names: Stellarium skycultures
  (modern / chinese), CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://stellarium.org).
- Milky Way panorama "ESO - Milky Way": ESO/S. Brunier, CC BY 4.0, via
  Wikimedia Commons.
- astronomy-engine (https://github.com/cosinekitty/astronomy): MIT.
- three.js: MIT.
